+
+	// The implementation of a digest or cipher in SoftHSM's own library context, never in
+	// the application's default one: a provider loaded there (such as pkcs11-provider using
+	// this very module) would otherwise be called back into while SoftHSM holds its locks.
+	// Falls back to the given one before OpenSSL 3, or if the context cannot be created.
+	const EVP_MD* fetched(const EVP_MD* md);
+	const EVP_CIPHER* fetched(const EVP_CIPHER* cipher);
